只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Generative, interactive UI for DeepSeek Harness (DSH): declarative components and sandboxed live widgets streamed in chat.","id":"gh:1412721907","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"deepseek-harness-intelligent-ui","slug":"dreamfarer-space/deepseek-harness-intelligent-ui","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","generative-ai","intelligent-ui"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Generative, interactive UI for DeepSeek Harness (DSH): declarative components and sandboxed live wid"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"gets streamed in chat."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"**English** · 中文"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Demo · Quick start · How it decides · Components · Widgets · Extending · Security · Configuration · "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"t · How it decides · Components · Widgets · Extending · Security · Configuration · Quality · Develop"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Generative, interactive UI for DeepSeek Harness (DSH). Ask in plain language and the agent decides o"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"n its own how to answer:"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- **plain text** when that reads best;\n- **native components**: dashboards, data grids, charts, scat"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ter plots and heatmaps, timelines, live function plots, KaTeX math, Mermaid diagrams, code diffs, fi"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"le trees, JSON trees, forms and choice cards;\n- a fully custom **sandboxed live widget**: Three.js s"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"cenes, canvas simulations, mini-apps."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The UI renders progressively while the answer streams. Sorting, filtering, sliders, rotation, zoom a"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"nd tabs respond instantly in the browser. Only explicit actions (a button, a form, a choice, `Bridge"},{"id":"p6s3","text":".sendPrompt`) go back to the agent, either in the current session or in a new one."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"It ports the ideas of CopilotKit's OpenIntelligentUI (Open Generative UI + A2UI-style declarative co"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"mponents) onto DSH's own extension points, with no CopilotKit, LangGraph or external router."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## ✨ Highlights"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### 🧠 Decides by itself\nNo command needed. Each turn the agent picks text, native components or a li"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ve widget, guided by a system-prompt section."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### ⚡ Streams progressively\nComponents appear while the JSON streams. Widgets morph into **one** ifr"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ame and finalize in place: no rebuild, no flash."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Feature tour"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Recorded live in the **DeepSeek Harness desktop app** with real DeepSeek models through the magpie g"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ateway; nothing is scripted. The camera follows the cursor and zooms into each interaction; waits fo"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"r the model are fast-forwarded (the badge shows the speed)."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**`Choice`: pick one option, continue here or start it in a new session** · DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1317993c-17b1-4fca-9356-c365afcc6101"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**`Table` as a data grid: typed sorting, search, per-column filters, paging, CSV export** · DeepSeek"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"s a data grid: typed sorting, search, per-column filters, paging, CSV export** · DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/be9c74e4-2ed3-402c-bd08-d57ea8516eec"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**`Scatter` and `Heatmap`: hover, tap and keyboard inspection; missing data hatched, never 0** · Dee"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" and `Heatmap`: hover, tap and keyboard inspection; missing data hatched, never 0** · DeepSeek-Flash"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cb575946-bab5-4551-9621-489dee55df07"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**`CodeDiff`, `FileTree` and `JsonView`: code as text, collapsible context, JSONPath copy** · DeepSe"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"iff`, `FileTree` and `JsonView`: code as text, collapsible context, JSONPath copy** · DeepSeek-Flash"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/75900041-3880-4e21-97f8-21bfd41872ad"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Where the UI appears, and what survives"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- While a turn runs, the UI renders inline in the tool call; one component instance spans preparing "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"→ running → result.\n- When the turn ends, DSH folds tool calls into the \"process\" section, so the pl"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ugin re-presents each UI **beneath the reply** and the inline copy shrinks to a pointer.\n- Interacti"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"on state is kept per UI in memory and in `localStorage` (bounded), so moving beneath the reply or re"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"loading restores it. The UIs themselves are rebuilt from the durable session log.\n- A stopped genera"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"tion keeps the finished part (a static widget preview or the completed components) with a notice and"},{"id":"p22s7","text":" **Regenerate**, even when DSH dropped a call that was still streaming."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## 🔒 Security model"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **Widget isolation:** `<iframe sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms\">` with `srcdoc` and **no** `all"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ow-same-origin`. The E2E verifies in a browser that `parent.document`, `localStorage` and `document."},{"id":"p24s3","text":"cookie` throw `SecurityError`, `fetch` is blocked, and `window.origin === \"null\"`.\n- **CSP:** `defau"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"lt-src 'none'`; scripts, styles, fonts and images only from `cdnAllowlist`; `connect-src 'none'` unl"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"ess `allowNetwork`; `form-action 'none'`; `base-uri 'none'`. A per-widget sandbox boundary audit wit"},{"id":"p24s6","text":"h the measured matrix is in docs/widget-csp-audit.md and runs as `npm run e2e:security`.\n- **What `a"},{"id":"p24s7","text":"llowNetwork=false` does and does not stop:** it blocks `fetch`, XHR, WebSocket, `EventSource`, `send"},{"id":"p24s8","text":"Beacon` and `<a ping>`. It does **not** stop `<img>`, `<script src>`, `<link rel=stylesheet>`, `@fon"},{"id":"p24s9","text":"t-face` or `<video>` from requesting an **allowlisted** origin, and this implementation emits origin"},{"id":"p24s10","text":"-only `cdnAllowlist` sources, without path restrictions — so an allowlisted CDN can still see widget"},{"id":"p24s11","text":" data in a resource URL. Set `cdnAllowlist: []` to block external resource requests; the offline bun"},{"id":"p24s12","text":"dle already does. This does not stop a widget navigating its own frame or sending data in that initi"},{"id":"p24s13","text":"al navigation URL.\n- **Navigation:** a document-bound MessageChannel prevents a replacement document"},{"id":"p24s14","text":" from receiving host data. A later iframe `load` removes the foreign UI; an unfinished response can "},{"id":"p24s15","text":"delay this visual removal. The initial self-navigation request is still possible. The iframe sandbox"},{"id":"p24s16","text":" blocks top-level navigation, `window.open` and file downloads. A cross-origin download link can sti"},{"id":"p24s17","text":"ll trigger a self-navigation request before the browser blocks saving the response.\n- **Messages:** "},{"id":"p24s18","text":"a one-time handshake validates the iframe source and fresh document token before accepting its trans"},{"id":"p24s19","text":"ferred port. All later messages use that port and validate token/shape; window RPCs and stale ports "},{"id":"p24s20","text":"are rejected (verified in E2E).\n- **`sendPrompt` limits:** refused for 1 s after mount, at most one "},{"id":"p24s21","text":"per 2 s, capped at `sendPromptMaxChars`, queued as a normal user message.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Limitations"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- The default online package needs reachable CDN resources for Math/Mermaid and imported widget libr"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"aries. The offline package covers Math, Mermaid and standard Three.js scenes; other addons, GSAP and"},{"id":"p26s3","text":" external media are not included. Library failures show an explicit fallback or script error.\n- Inte"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"raction state is per browser (`localStorage`), not synced across devices.\n- A call dropped while str"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"eaming is matched to its turn by start/end time; a large clock offset between a remote DSH host and "},{"id":"p26s6","text":"the browser could hide that card."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
